  "description": "Add a bold and timeless touch to your creative projects with this Red Stripes & Polka Dot Seamless Pattern Bundle. Featuring classic diagonal stripes, vintage pinstripes, playful polka dots, candy-inspired stripe designs, and clean geometric patterns in vibrant red, white, black, and burgundy tones, this collection is perfect for holiday crafts, sublimation, scrapbooking, fabric printing, stationery, party decorations, wrapping paper, and digital backgrounds.\nThese versatile seamless patterns offer a modern retro aesthetic suitable for Valentine’s Day, Christmas projects, patriotic themes, classroom resources, packaging, and year-round creative designs.\nYou Will Receive\n➤ 20 High-Resolution JPEG Files\n➤ 12″ x 12″ Inches\n➤ 300 DPI Resolution\n➤ Seamless Repeating Patterns\n➤ Print & Digital Use\nFeatures\n➤ Classic red and white color palette\n➤ Playful polka dot patterns\n➤ Bold diagonal stripe designs\n➤ Vintage pinstripe backgrounds\n➤ Clean geometric layouts\n➤ Seamless repeating patterns\n➤ High-quality printable papers\n➤ Perfect for crafting and commercial projects",
